      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bottineau%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Bottineau hosts North Dakota’s oldest county fair, the Bottineau County Fair, every year.",
